whether the asynchronous operation has finished.\n\nIf this function returns TRUE, get(), GetResult() and the wait(</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a> &amp; <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00335\">operator=</a> (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a> &amp;)=delete;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Copy assignment operator shall be disabled</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a> &amp; <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00325\">operator=</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a> &amp;&amp;other) noexcept;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Move assign from another instance</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\">template &lt;typename F, typename ExecutorT&gt; auto <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00337\">then</a> (F &amp;&amp;func, ExecutorT &amp;&amp;executor) noexcept -&gt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a>&lt; &lt;see below&gt; &gt;;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Create a new Future with the content returned by func when passed the Result of this Future</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\">template &lt;typename F&gt; auto <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00331\">then</a> (F &amp;&amp;func) noexcept -&gt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html#SWS_CORE_00334\">Future</a>&lt; &lt;see below&gt; &gt;;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Create a new Future with the content returned by func when passed the Result of this Future</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\">bool <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00327\">valid</a> () const noexcept;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Checks if the Future is valid, i.e</span></li><li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_CORE_00328\">wait</a> () const noexcept;</code> <span class=\"dim\">Wait for a value or an error to b